        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42408</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42408"/>
        <updated>2025-12-15T21:00:31.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Continuing on from <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3717107679" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42346" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42346/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42346">#42346</a>, this PR replaces links in <code class="notranslate">files/en-us/web/html</code> with the macro:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>
<p dir="auto">Selector links: <code class="notranslate">/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Selectors/</code> → <code class="notranslate">{{cssxref(":selector")}}</code> and <code class="notranslate">{{cssxref("::selector")}}</code></p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">At-rule links: <code class="notranslate">/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/At-rules/</code> → <code class="notranslate">{{cssxref("@at-rule")}}</code></p>
</li>
<li>
<p dir="auto">Value links: <code class="notranslate">/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/</code> → <code class="notranslate">{{cssxref("keyword")}}</code>, <code class="notranslate">{{cssxref("function()")}}</code>, and <code class="notranslate">{{cssxref("data-type")}}</code></p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Because of special treatment of <code class="notranslate">Web/CSS/Reference/Values/Color_value</code>, <code class="notranslate">{{cssxref("color_value", "&amp;lt;color&amp;gt;")}}</code> has been replaced with  <code class="notranslate">{{cssxref("&amp;lt;color&amp;gt;")}}</code>.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">See "Additional details" and "Motivation" in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3717107679" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42346" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42346/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42346">#42346</a> for more context.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3731120395" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42407" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42407/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42407">#42407</a></li>
